#: pm_email_notify:mail:mail:body
msgctxt "mail:mail:body"
msgid ""
"Hi [privatemsg_message:recipient],\r\n"
"\r\n"
"This is an automatic reminder from the site [site:name]. You have received a new private message from [privatemsg_message:author].\r\n"
"\r\n"
"To read your message, follow this link:\r\n"
"[privatemsg_message:url]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"If you don't want to receive these emails again, change your preferences here:\r\n"
"[privatemsg_message:recipient:edit-url]"
msgstr ""
"[privatemsg_message:recipient], \r\n"
"\r\n"
"Toto je automatický oznam o správe z aplikácie [site:name], zaslanej používateľom [privatemsg_message:author].\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Správu si môžte prečítať na tejto adrese:\r\n"
"[privatemsg_message:url]\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Ak nechcete naďalej dostávať tieto oznamy, môžte ich zasielanie zastaviť tu:\r\n"
"[privatemsg_message:recipient:edit-url]"

#: pm_email_notify:mail:mail:subject
msgctxt "mail:mail:subject"
msgid "New private message at [site:name]."
msgstr "Nová správa z aplikácie [site:name]."
